      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-2b90d051-34f1-4be7-adae-02aa33df2aa7-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 15px;">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2025/04/11476498/playbookcolumbus-head-opt2-800x300-original_original.png" style="width: 570px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="Playbook Columbus Header " width="570" height="214"><h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0.67em 0 20px;">Playbook Columbus: You’ve Helped Shape the Plan—Now Come See What’s Next</h1>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><hr></td></tr></table>
<p class="" data-start="240" data-end="467" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 1em 0 15px;">Thank you for being an important part of Playbook Columbus—our next 10-year Vision Plan for recreation and parks. As a key stakeholder, you have helped shape the foundation of this work, and we’re excited to share the progress with you!</p>
<p class="" data-start="469" data-end="753" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We’re now entering the next phase, and your continued input is essential. We invite you to join us at an upcoming Playbook Columbus Open House this May to review and comment on the draft goals and big moves that will guide the future of our parks, trails and community spaces.</p>
<p class="" data-start="755" data-end="956" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Open houses begin May 12 and will be held across the city. These are casual, drop-in style events—come and go as your schedule allows, and feel free to bring friends, neighbors and colleagues.</p>
<ul data-start="101" data-end="772" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<li class="" data-start="101" data-end="165" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin-top: 0px;">
<p class="" data-start="103" data-end="165" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong data-start="103" data-end="134">Monday, May 12, 5:30–7 p.m.</strong> – Whetstone Community Center</p>
</li>
<li class="" data-start="166" data-end="226" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467;">
<p class="" data-start="168" data-end="226" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong data-start="168" data-end="200">Tuesday, May 13, 5:30–7 p.m.</strong> – Warner Woods Pavilion</p>
</li>
<li class="" data-start="227" data-end="300" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467;">
<p class="" data-start="229" data-end="300" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong data-start="229" data-end="263">Wednesday, May 14, 5:30–7 p.m.</strong> – Marion Franklin Community Center</p>
</li>
<li class="" data-start="301" data-end="371" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467;">
<p class="" data-start="303" data-end="371" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong data-start="303" data-end="336">Thursday, May 15, 5:30–7 p.m.</strong> – Lazelle Woods Community Center</p>
</li>
<li class="" data-start="372" data-end="430" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467;">
<p class="" data-start="374" data-end="430" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong data-start="374" data-end="409">Saturday, May 17, 10–11:30 a.m.</strong> – Fran Ryan Center</p>
</li>
<li class="" data-start="431" data-end="501" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467;">
<p class="" data-start="433" data-end="501" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong data-start="433" data-end="465">Tuesday, May 20, 5:30–7 p.m.</strong> – Carriage Place Community Center</p>
</li>
<li class="" data-start="502" data-end="568" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467;">
<p class="" data-start="504" data-end="568" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong data-start="504" data-end="538">Wednesday, May 21, 5:30–7 p.m.</strong> – Westgate Community Center</p>
</li>
<li class="" data-start="569" data-end="632" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467;">
<p class="" data-start="571" data-end="632" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong data-start="571" data-end="604">Thursday, May 22, 5:30–7 p.m.</strong> – Big Walnut Shelterhouse</p>
</li>
<li class="" data-start="633" data-end="702" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467;">
<p class="" data-start="635" data-end="702" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong data-start="635" data-end="667">Tuesday, May 27, 5:30–7 p.m.</strong> – Woodward Park Community Center</p>
</li>
<li class="" data-start="703" data-end="772" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin-bottom: 15px;">
<p class="" data-start="705" data-end="772" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong data-start="705" data-end="739">Wednesday, May 28, 5:30–7 p.m.</strong> – Raymond Memorial Golf Course</p>
</li>
</ul>
<table class="govd_button" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;"><tbody><tr><td style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding-bottom: 15px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; margin: 0 auto;" align="center"><tbody><tr><td class="govd_button" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background-color: #e31b23; border-radius: 5px; text-align: center; display: inline-block; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; padding: 10px; border: none;" align="center" bgcolor="#e31b23"><a href="https://www.playbookcolumbus.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; text-decoration: none !important;"><strong style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none;">See the Full Schedule</strong></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>
<p class="" data-start="1073" data-end="1258" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 1em 0 15px;">Please also help us spread the word by sharing the event info with your networks. Your voice—and your reach—can help ensure this plan reflects the diverse needs of our entire community.</p>
<p class="" data-start="1073" data-end="1258" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Learn more at <a href="https://www.playbookcolumbus.com?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_new" class="" data-start="1011" data-end="1071" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">PlaybookColumbus.com</a>.</p>
<p class="" data-start="1260" data-end="1336" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Thank you again for your partnership and support. We hope to see you in May!</p>
